Subject: [PATCH] release: modern build defaults and pipeline-validated status

---
 CMakeLists.txt                     | 49 ++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 README.md                          | 12 ++++++++
 Source/Lib/ASM_AVX2/CMakeLists.txt | 20 ++++++------
